  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2304.03 Defective Decal. In the event an owner is issued a defective decal by the department or its agent, the owner shall return it to the department and shall be issued a replacement decal without charge.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss by #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
